Architecture: all
Maintainer: Stephen Mott <stephen@mott.email>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), udev, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://herdr.dev
Description: SDINNOVATION SIDE-KEYBOARD as a herdr controller
 Turns the 16-key, 3-knob SDINNOVATION SIDE-KEYBOARD (6d7d:dcfc) into a
 controller for herdr workspaces and agents: knobs switch workspace, agent
 and brightness, keys focus agents and answer their prompts, and the key
 LEDs show each agent's status. Runs as the systemd user service agentpad.
